{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_06",
  "title": "安魂曲",
  "storyCode": "GA-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f49e2f79c4bc9d506fb5cd17d1a5a71e980f7e664d3da9c3f6a1549bcd1740f7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "艾泽尔，左前方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说，咱们也打不出个结果，要不然算了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真是完全不听人说话啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾泽尔，你不是最担心塞茜莉亚的安危吗？其实说不定塞茜莉亚在我手里会更安全哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以为我会相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从来不说假话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你说的是真的，塞茜莉亚自己不愿意，那就不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有时候我真觉得，安多恩给我添了很多麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "不要分神，艾泽尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......费德里科前辈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有没有感觉到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥伦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "艾泽尔，行动变更，你去钟楼确认情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": "char_279_excu_4",
      "operatorId": "char_279_excu",
      "portraitKey": "char_279_excu",
      "text": "这个反叛信使交给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教宗阁下，这是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薇尔丽芙，关闭中厅，暂停一切会面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到底发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的前任，上一代教宗，很喜欢研究历史，这件事你听说过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......确实没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不怪你，他实在太蹩脚了。他那些文章错漏百出，让人不敢恭维。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与其说是在研究历史，不如说他喜欢把历史当成材料，尽情发挥他的想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他喜欢写一些相当......浪漫主义的比喻。虽然放在历史论文里实在有滥情的嫌疑，但确实能给人留下印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他说，“历史，就是无形的巨人在大地上谱写的无限多声部的乐章”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "照他这个比喻，我们这位巨人音乐家，可能写到新的一小节了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n肺里的空气被竭尽全力挤压而出，又被深吸回肺中。\n我绊了一跤，挣扎着爬起来，又向前冲去。\n我能清晰感觉到，有什么东西正在酝酿。\n就在钟楼顶层，就在那扇门之后，就在塞茜莉亚所在的地方。\n推开门——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那个瘦弱的女孩在唱歌。\n一首古老的萨卡兹歌谣。\n她唱得如此真挚，嗓音稚嫩，投入了全部的情感。\n我只能呆呆站在原地，竭尽全力屏住呼吸，生怕我杂乱的气息打扰了歌声的流动。\n在某个瞬间，我突然发现自己什么也听不到了。\n唯有钟声，仿佛跨越亘古而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......钟声......从启示石塔传来......这怎么可能......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那口钟从来没有响过啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......只在，只在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "数千年前，初代圣徒还行走于地上的时代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“日间，萨科塔见天上乌黑，不见太阳。夜间，魔鬼的军兵追来，戕害众多萨科塔。萨科塔失去许多辉光。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“众圣徒说：跟随我。于是石塔矗立。众圣徒说：聆听我。于是钟声鸣响。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的市民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“钟声回荡在旷野，萨科塔便结成一心。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虔诚的市民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“这是启示，这是箴言。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的市民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“日间便有亮光，不再被遮挡。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虔诚的市民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“众圣徒说：建筑一座城市，乃是萨科塔的乐园。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“众圣徒说：这城该叫拉特兰。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "启示石塔是拉特兰最古老的建筑之一，不，如果按典籍所载，是先有启示石塔，再有拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而圣钟于此刻再度响起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我们的小塞茜莉亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可，为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许那位无形的巨人音乐家想要写几个强音，看上了拉特兰的老钟，在配器时选中它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "枢机薇尔丽芙，此刻在这圣堂中的却是你我，不知是幸运，还是不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......教宗阁下，我们必须立刻查清圣钟鸣响的原因......不，不论是什么原因，给出这个原因、解释这个原因的......必须是教廷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正值诸国使节齐聚拉特兰，出席代表皆为见证者，这未尝不是个机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去吧，薇尔丽芙，晓谕诸使节，拉特兰的钟声数千年后再度响起，这是变革的预兆，我们必须联合，为将来做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那启示石塔......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等待已经足够了，就开始工作吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先导，您......难道早就知道了？塞茜莉亚到底是什么人......她，她虽然是混血，但......难道还有什么隐藏的秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，怎么可能。她只是你我所知的塞茜莉亚而已，或许身世有一点特别，但并无玄奥隐秘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许只是，拉特兰本身都在渴求改变，塞茜莉亚......刚好遭遇了这个时刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又或者，她真是那个能够弥平萨卡兹和萨科塔千年裂痕的人，以至于启示为她而降，圣钟为她而鸣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，也有可能只是个误会，是个巧合，是个埋藏在历史中的黑色幽默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们都知道，真相从来不是最重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......不管怎样，这给了我们机会。要我说，这未尝不是我们被眷顾的证明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教廷的精力现在应该都放在了使节区和启示石塔那边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们会为您铺就那条路。您只需向前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......安多恩，钟声响了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那钟声属于一个即将启程的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的语气很轻松，你决定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的决定从未改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算会付出一切？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算会付出一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这有意义吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "意义啊......意义不会凭空存在。我们的一切选择，不过是构想它，塑造它，给它降临的机会而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "愿你终能平静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帕蒂亚，你刚才的那句话，有违我们的初衷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人人皆为基石，我们所交叠夯筑的坦途，留给后来者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我必须立刻觐见教宗阁下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，教宗阁下正在祈祷，暂时不见任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请您谅解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爆炸声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大概又是市民们的恶作剧吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对！爆炸声是从使节区传来的，那里已经停止所有爆破活动的审批了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戍卫队",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铳......铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，使节区受到袭击！城内还有多处发生火灾和爆炸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "迷途者！听到圣钟长鸣，他们终于也坐不住了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戍卫队",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然之前已有铳骑阁下拨驻使节区，但......袭击和爆炸开始之后，使节们情绪激化，强烈要求增派铳骑保护......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可恶，偏偏是这个时候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "枢机薇尔丽芙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "启示石塔的圣钟再度鸣响，这是属于拉特兰的至圣时刻，首届“万国峰会”与各国使节也同蒙恩典，我们都该为此喜悦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然而异端残党却趁机作乱，企图扰乱会议，黯淡拉特兰的荣光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，奉教宗谕令，请您前往使节区，与诸铳骑一同保护各国使节，确保万国峰会如期开幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我将与你同往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的。我说，枢机......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一定也感觉到了，从启示石塔蔓延出的那股力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请慎言，铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是荣光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蕾缪安，这也是他干的好事吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......或许是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事到如今，你还打算包庇他？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "菲亚梅塔，过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我向你道歉，菲亚梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前天，我不该对你说那样的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你先放开我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除非你原谅我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我确实生你的气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但更让我生气的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也许我是在气我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有一点，我希望你相信我，菲亚梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#7$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果他真的想要危害拉特兰......我绝不会放过他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他究竟想要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也许，他是想问一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "问谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......教宗阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......什么问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个萨科塔不该问的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能说明白点吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......因为我也不太确定。这个问题应该在他心里埋了很久了......他也没有说过。只是我的推测。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但八年前的事，确实与这个问题有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等等。所以，莫斯提马，你也知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么可能，我和蕾缪安不一样，菲亚梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蕾缪安也许是因为理解他，而我嘛......我只是因为，他不值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要我说，他挺可怜的。而我还有更重要的事要忙。就这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我怎么觉得你比蕾缪安还让我生气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不一样，菲亚梅塔。我做了能做的一切。而你......我猜你宁愿是我，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蕾缪安，你还知道什么，都告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为你不会想听？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总要听了才知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞茜莉亚·拉珀尔塔，我奉教宗谕令，前来保护你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是因为钟响了吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "钟响，和我有关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无可奉告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请你即刻动身，随我前往大教堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾泽尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾泽尔哥哥，没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亚",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
